## 3. Cấu trúc chuẩn (flat `apps/*` + `packages/*` — KHÔNG đổi workspace/turbo config)

Monorepo là source-control strategy, KHÔNG phải deployment model. Giữ flat, phân biệt bằng **naming prefix**,
deploy vẫn per-app bằng `turbo run <task> --filter=@megawin/operator-<app>...`.

```
apps/
  # ── OPERATOR — FE (Next.js 16, theo tiền lệ apps/backoffice) ──
  operator-web/               @megawin/operator-web              player: game + ví + My Account + (support)
  operator-backoffice/        @megawin/operator-backoffice       nhân viên operator (duyệt rút, KYC, CS console)
  operator-affiliate-portal/  @megawin/operator-affiliate-portal đại lý/affiliate B2C

  # ── OPERATOR — Backend (product prefix TRƯỚC, runtime suffix SAU) ──
  operator-api/               @megawin/operator-api              Lambda+Middy — BFF chính
  operator-support-api/       @megawin/operator-support-api      Lambda+Middy — orchestration CS
  operator-wallet-svc/        @megawin/operator-wallet-svc       ECS Fargate — ví+ledger (Postgres, stateful)
  operator-worker-payout/     @megawin/operator-worker-payout    Lambda — payout async
  operator-worker-reconcile/  @megawin/operator-worker-reconcile Lambda — đối soát core↔operator↔PSP
  operator-worker-support/    @megawin/operator-worker-support   Lambda — sync context CS, proactive msg

packages/
  # ── OPERATOR domain + application (mirror game-*/game-*-application) ──
  operator-core/              operator-core-application/         domain + repos/use-cases chung operator (Mongo)
  operator-wallet/            operator-wallet-application/       ví double-entry + infra Postgres
  operator-payment/           operator-payment-application/      PSP adapter (VNPay/MoMo/VietQR)
  operator-affiliate/         operator-affiliate-application/    cây đại lý + commission engine (NGR/RevShare)
  operator-support/           operator-support-application/      domain + repos/use-cases CS (Mongo)
  operator-bonus/             operator-bonus-application/        (P5) ví bonus + wagering requirement
  operator-kyc/               operator-kyc-application/          (P2) eKYC, tài liệu, tiers
  operator-risk/              operator-risk-application/         (P5) rule engine, fraud score

  # ── OPERATOR infra/support mới ──
  operator-data-sql/          @megawin/operator-data-sql         Postgres layer (song song @megawin/data Mongo)
  operator-auth/              @megawin/operator-auth             Operator IdP (better-auth/Cognito player pool + map B2B core)
  operator-support-ai/        @megawin/operator-support-ai       abstraction AI/RAG (Comm100|Bedrock|self-hosted)
  operator-channel-adapters/  @megawin/operator-channel-adapters Zalo/Telegram/WhatsApp/Email → 1 message shape
```

Runtime suffix hợp lệ: `-web`, `-backoffice`, `-portal`, `-api`, `-svc` (service dài hạn stateful), `-worker-<job>`.

`-svc` là suffix MỚI dành riêng service dài hạn (ECS Fargate, connection pool, transaction dài) — báo hiệu
"không deploy như Lambda". Dùng tiết kiệm, đúng bản chất.

